# policy.matrix: what the gate of "testkit" decides, for every action and every kind of caller.
# Written by `pnpm policy:matrix` from the compiled policy (policy.yaml, identity.yaml) and the
# app's policy matrix (TestingHooks.policyMatrix); a test fails when it differs. Never edit it by
# hand: a difference here is a change in what the agent may do, to be reviewed as the policy is.
#
# Under each action (its level and its rules as the file writes them), a row per kind of caller.
# A row with one verdict holds for every call that caller can make; otherwise its lines split it
# by what the call carries, a|b meaning either value. "as <caller>" repeats that caller's verdicts.
#
# callers
#   anonymous          no one proven (level 0)
#   subject@1          customer, level 1 (one of the app's subjects)
#   subject@2          customer, level 2 (one of the app's subjects)
#   delegate:viewer    agent, role viewer, level 2
#   delegate:clerk     agent, role clerk, level 2
#   delegate:viewer@1  agent, role viewer, level 1 (a delegate below level 2)
#   unlisted-role      agent, role supervisor, level 2 (a role the policy does not name)
#   roleless           agent with no role, level 2
#   other-party        visitor, level 2 (neither a subject nor of a delegate kind)
# what a call carries
#   purpose     none; entry-check, retry-check (the lifecycle's probes); a form's purpose
#   subject     own; inScope (a subject the delegates act for); outOfScope; unknown; empty
#   fields      exact; extra (one field more); missing (one field less: the subject's own when it is the only one)
#   confirmed   none; match (the caller confirmed exactly these values); mismatch
#   attempts    0; 3 (the maximum)
#   params      the policy matrix's named sets of values for the action
# verdicts: ALLOW; BLOCK <reason>; STEP_UP to <level>; NEEDS_HUMAN <reason>

purposes: report_missing needs level 2

verifyCustomer · level 0 · attempts(3)
  anonymous          attempts 0  ALLOW
                     attempts 3  NEEDS_HUMAN attempts
  subject@1          as anonymous
  subject@2          as anonymous
  delegate:viewer    BLOCK not-subject
  delegate:clerk     as delegate:viewer
  delegate:viewer@1  as delegate:viewer
  unlisted-role      as delegate:viewer
  roleless           as delegate:viewer
  other-party        as delegate:viewer

verifyCode · level 1 · identity, attempts(3)
  anonymous          purpose none|entry-check|retry-check  STEP_UP to 1
                     purpose report_missing                STEP_UP to 2
  subject@1          purpose none|entry-check|retry-check, attempts 0  ALLOW
                     purpose none|entry-check|retry-check, attempts 3  NEEDS_HUMAN attempts
                     purpose report_missing                            STEP_UP to 2
  subject@2          attempts 0  ALLOW
                     attempts 3  NEEDS_HUMAN attempts
  delegate:viewer    BLOCK not-subject
  delegate:clerk     as delegate:viewer
  delegate:viewer@1  as delegate:viewer
  unlisted-role      as delegate:viewer
  roleless           as delegate:viewer
  other-party        as delegate:viewer

sendCode · level 1 · identity, scope(accountId)
  anonymous          purpose none|entry-check|retry-check  STEP_UP to 1
                     purpose report_missing                STEP_UP to 2
  subject@1          purpose none|entry-check|retry-check, subject own, fields exact|extra           ALLOW
                     purpose none|entry-check|retry-check, subject own, fields missing               BLOCK scope
                     purpose none|entry-check|retry-check, subject inScope|outOfScope|unknown|empty  BLOCK scope
                     purpose report_missing                                                          STEP_UP to 2
  subject@2          subject own, fields exact|extra           ALLOW
                     subject own, fields missing               BLOCK scope
                     subject inScope|outOfScope|unknown|empty  BLOCK scope
  delegate:viewer    BLOCK not-subject
  delegate:clerk     as delegate:viewer
  delegate:viewer@1  as delegate:viewer
  unlisted-role      as delegate:viewer
  roleless           as delegate:viewer
  other-party        as delegate:viewer

getAccount · level 1 · identity, scope(accountId)
  anonymous          purpose none|entry-check|retry-check  STEP_UP to 1
                     purpose report_missing                STEP_UP to 2
  subject@1          purpose none|entry-check|retry-check, subject own, fields exact|extra           ALLOW
                     purpose none|entry-check|retry-check, subject own, fields missing               BLOCK scope
                     purpose none|entry-check|retry-check, subject inScope|outOfScope|unknown|empty  BLOCK scope
                     purpose report_missing                                                          STEP_UP to 2
  subject@2          subject own, fields exact|extra           ALLOW
                     subject own, fields missing               BLOCK scope
                     subject inScope|outOfScope|unknown|empty  BLOCK scope
  delegate:viewer    subject own|inScope, fields exact|extra  ALLOW
                     subject own|inScope, fields missing      BLOCK scope
                     subject outOfScope|unknown|empty         BLOCK scope
  delegate:clerk     as delegate:viewer
  delegate:viewer@1  purpose none|entry-check|retry-check, subject own|inScope, fields exact|extra  ALLOW
                     purpose none|entry-check|retry-check, subject own|inScope, fields missing      BLOCK scope
                     purpose none|entry-check|retry-check, subject outOfScope|unknown|empty         BLOCK scope
                     purpose report_missing                                                         BLOCK identity
  unlisted-role      as delegate:viewer
  roleless           as delegate:viewer
  other-party        BLOCK scope

getWindows · level 1 · identity, scope(accountId)
  anonymous          purpose none|entry-check|retry-check  STEP_UP to 1
                     purpose report_missing                STEP_UP to 2
  subject@1          purpose none|entry-check|retry-check, subject own, fields exact|extra           ALLOW
                     purpose none|entry-check|retry-check, subject own, fields missing               BLOCK scope
                     purpose none|entry-check|retry-check, subject inScope|outOfScope|unknown|empty  BLOCK scope
                     purpose report_missing                                                          STEP_UP to 2
  subject@2          subject own, fields exact|extra           ALLOW
                     subject own, fields missing               BLOCK scope
                     subject inScope|outOfScope|unknown|empty  BLOCK scope
  delegate:viewer    subject own|inScope, fields exact|extra  ALLOW
                     subject own|inScope, fields missing      BLOCK scope
                     subject outOfScope|unknown|empty         BLOCK scope
  delegate:clerk     as delegate:viewer
  delegate:viewer@1  purpose none|entry-check|retry-check, subject own|inScope, fields exact|extra  ALLOW
                     purpose none|entry-check|retry-check, subject own|inScope, fields missing      BLOCK scope
                     purpose none|entry-check|retry-check, subject outOfScope|unknown|empty         BLOCK scope
                     purpose report_missing                                                         BLOCK identity
  unlisted-role      as delegate:viewer
  roleless           as delegate:viewer
  other-party        BLOCK scope

listParcels · level 2 · identity, scope(accountId)
  anonymous          STEP_UP to 2
  subject@1          as anonymous
  subject@2          subject own, fields exact|extra           ALLOW
                     subject own, fields missing               BLOCK scope
                     subject inScope|outOfScope|unknown|empty  BLOCK scope
  delegate:viewer    subject own|inScope, fields exact|extra  ALLOW
                     subject own|inScope, fields missing      BLOCK scope
                     subject outOfScope|unknown|empty         BLOCK scope
  delegate:clerk     as delegate:viewer
  delegate:viewer@1  BLOCK identity
  unlisted-role      as delegate:viewer
  roleless           as delegate:viewer
  other-party        BLOCK scope

getParcel · level 2 · identity, scope(record parcel)
  anonymous          STEP_UP to 2
  subject@1          as anonymous
  subject@2          subject own, fields exact|extra           ALLOW
                     subject own, fields missing               BLOCK scope
                     subject inScope|outOfScope|unknown|empty  BLOCK scope
  delegate:viewer    subject own|inScope, fields exact|extra  ALLOW
                     subject own|inScope, fields missing      BLOCK scope
                     subject outOfScope|unknown|empty         BLOCK scope
  delegate:clerk     as delegate:viewer
  delegate:viewer@1  BLOCK identity
  unlisted-role      as delegate:viewer
  roleless           as delegate:viewer
  other-party        BLOCK scope

createReport · level 2 · identity, role(viewer refuse, clerk person), scope(accountId), confirmed(accountId, missingNote, expectedDate), custom R8
  anonymous          STEP_UP to 2
  subject@1          as anonymous
  subject@2          subject own, fields exact, confirmed none|mismatch            BLOCK confirmation
                     subject own, fields exact, confirmed match, params due        ALLOW
                     subject own, fields exact, confirmed match, params delivered  NEEDS_HUMAN delivered
                     subject own, fields exact, confirmed match, params undated    BLOCK unchecked
                     subject own, fields extra|missing                             BLOCK confirmation
                     subject inScope|outOfScope|unknown|empty                      BLOCK scope
  delegate:viewer    BLOCK role
  delegate:clerk     NEEDS_HUMAN role-person
  delegate:viewer@1  BLOCK identity
  unlisted-role      as delegate:viewer
  roleless           as delegate:viewer
  other-party        as delegate:viewer

notifyDepot · level 2 · identity, scope(record report), fields(report, missingNote, expectedDate)
  anonymous          STEP_UP to 2
  subject@1          as anonymous
  subject@2          subject own, fields exact|missing         ALLOW
                     subject own, fields extra                 BLOCK minimization
                     subject inScope|outOfScope|unknown|empty  BLOCK scope
  delegate:viewer    subject own|inScope, fields exact|missing  ALLOW
                     subject own|inScope, fields extra          BLOCK minimization
                     subject outOfScope|unknown|empty           BLOCK scope
  delegate:clerk     as delegate:viewer
  delegate:viewer@1  BLOCK identity
  unlisted-role      as delegate:viewer
  roleless           as delegate:viewer
  other-party        BLOCK scope

(unlisted) · not in the policy
  every caller       BLOCK unknown-tool

custom rules, and their examples as the gate decides them in each action that names the rule
  R8: No parcel of the customer's was delivered on the day it was due
    createReport  due on a day nothing of theirs was delivered  ALLOW
    createReport  due on the day their boots were delivered     NEEDS_HUMAN delivered
    createReport  due on no date at all                         BLOCK unchecked
    createReport  lookups that cannot say                       BLOCK unchecked
